+// Control Center patch: the thread that installed the show/hide hooks. The IAT
+// patch below rewrites ShowWindow in EVERY loaded module, so it also runs for
+// windows that third-party DLLs create and show on their own UI threads
+// (WinSparkle's update dialog, for one). The will-show/will-hide hooks are
+// bound to that installing thread (the Dart binding wraps them in an
+// isolate-local NativeCallable, which aborts the process when entered from any
+// other thread), and the windows they style all live on it.
+static DWORD g_hooks_thread = 0;
 
